<title>USA: Thompson PBE distributes preferred rights.</title>
<headline>Thompson PBE distributes preferred rights.</headline>
<dateline>MARINA DEL REY, Calif. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thompson PBE Inc said its board declared a dividend distribution of one preferred share purchase right for each outstanding Thompson PBE share, in order to ensure shareholders received fair treatment in the event of a takeover proposal.</p>
<p>When exercisable, rights would entitle stockholders to buy one one-hundredth of a share of the newly created series A junior participating preferrred stock of the company at an initial exercise price of $25 per right, it said.</p>
<p>The dividend distribution was payable to stockholders of record on May 29, the company said.</p>
<p>--New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
